# Sneak {1}{W} is cast only "during your declare blockers step" (CR 702.190a), returning an unblocked creature. It is refused
# in the main phase, and in the declare blockers step when the only attacker was blocked by Bot2's Ornithopter (so it has
# no creature to return, CR 509.1h). The positive control is the sneak scenario that casts it with an unblocked attacker.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Ornithopter
The Last Ronin's Technique
Plains x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
